# Keep the build context minimal. The Dockerfile only COPYs cmd/ internal/
# pkg/ web/, but anything not excluded here is still sent to the daemon.
# NOTE: no "!" re-include patterns — they force Docker to walk into excluded
# dirs (pgdata/ is uid 70, mode 700, and unreadable to the build).
.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
pgdata
bin
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.db
*.sqlite*
*.log
*.md
LICENSE
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.agents
